@startuml
!include ../../common/style.puml
title phase_reached state machine
[*] --> QUEUED
state "Not run — no side effect" as NR {
  state "SKIPPED_IDEMPOTENT (success)\nSKIPPED_IN_PROGRESS\nREJECTED_CONFLICT\nRECOVERY_REQUIRED\nFAILED_FINAL" as DUP
  state "REJECTED_OVERLOAD" as OV
  state "REJECTED_INVALID" as INV
}
QUEUED --> DUP : claim ≠ CLAIMED
QUEUED --> INV : requested phase cannot run\n(checked before the claim)
QUEUED --> OV : admission timeout
QUEUED --> FAILED_G2C_P0 : Phase A reports failure
QUEUED --> G2C_P0_DONE : Phase A ok
G2C_P0_DONE --> FAILED_A2C : no dev_request, invalid\ndev_request, or Phase B errors
G2C_P0_DONE --> A2C_DONE : Phase B ok
G2C_P0_DONE --> E2A_VERIFIED : B skipped, C ok
A2C_DONE --> E2A_VERIFIED : Phase C ok
state "Exception (incl. Phase C failure,\nexpired deadline, store conflict)" as EX
EX : phase_reached keeps its last value;\nfailed_keys += key; compensate by phase
QUEUED -[dashed]-> EX
G2C_P0_DONE -[dashed]-> EX
A2C_DONE -[dashed]-> EX
E2A_VERIFIED --> [*]
@enduml
